Spec: Windows and Java authenticated transport conformance

Purpose:
  Execute actual cross-implementation device handshakes, authorized business transfer and revocation.

Structure:
  ./InteropHarness: Windows owner and publisher fixture.
  ./java: JVM Agent-role transport fixture with a separately generated device key.

Owns:
  ./verify.ps1
  ./README.md

Must:
  Generate each device key at its own endpoint and exchange only CSR and public certificates.
  Verify wrong peer, missing grant, large transfer integrity, half-close and revoked active streams.
  Keep all fixture state isolated and label JVM protocol conformance separately from Android Binder or device acceptance.
